        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Pending: 创建采集任务 / 校验任务参数\n\n    Pending --&gt; Running: 调度触发 [worker可用且未停止] / 启动任务\n    Pending --&gt; Stopped: 管理员取消 / 标记停止\n\n    Running --&gt; Succeeded: 采集完成 [校验通过] / 更新增量水位，触发ETL与索引\n    Running --&gt; Failed: 异常/超时/校验失败 / 记录错误码与日志\n    Running --&gt; Stopped: 管理员强制停止 / 中断任务，释放资源\n\n    Failed --&gt; Retrying: 自动重试 [retryCount 小于 maxRetry 且 未人工停止] / retryCount++\n    Failed --&gt; Stopped: 重试耗尽 [retryCount 大于等于 maxRetry] 或 人工终止 / 标记停止\n\n    Retrying --&gt; Running: 退避结束 [未停止] / 重新调度\n    Retrying --&gt; Stopped: 管理员停止 / 标记停止\n\n    Succeeded --&gt; [*]\n    Stopped --&gt; [*]\n\n    state \&quot;待执行(PENDING)\&quot; as Pending\n    Pending: entry / 写入任务记录\n    Pending: do / 等待调度\n\n    state \&quot;运行中(RUNNING)\&quot; as Running\n    Running: entry / 记录开始时间，启动心跳\n    Running: do / 执行爬取链路：连接→请求/翻页→解析→清洗→去重→入库→校验\n    Running: exit / 记录结束时间，释放资源\n\n    state \&quot;成功(SUCCEEDED)\&quot; as Succeeded\n    Succeeded: entry / 更新任务成功，写增量游标，触发ETL/索引\n\n    state \&quot;失败(FAILED)\&quot; as Failed\n    Failed: entry / 记录错误码、错误信息、堆栈\n\n    state \&quot;重试(RETRYING)\&quot; as Retrying\n    Retrying: entry / 计算指数退避时间\n    Retrying: do / 等待退避\n\n    state \&quot;已停止(STOPPED)\&quot; as Stopped\n    Stopped: entry / 标记停止原因，写审计日志，释放资源&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="LRlrLUbhrNiiWLiWKsMA-1">
